    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d700">

                <pb facs="0695" n="579" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg579"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 365.117/170.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Ambassador
                    Page</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 28, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>332. Your despatch August 20. Ask early decision Ajello case, calling attention
                    Ajello served as juryman on several occasions New York courts, fulfilling his
                    duties as American citizen.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
